  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&bull;<strong> Brand introduction:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">VeriNatural was founded out of a passion for greenery, creating high-quality, realistic artificial plants that require no maintenance, allowing everyone to effortlessly enjoy the tranquility of nature. We provide realistic and stylish artificial greenery for both personal and commercial spaces.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&bull;<strong> Product description:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>High Realism: </strong>Designed with premium materials for a lifelike appearance.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No Maintenance:</strong> No watering or pruning required&mdash;effortless beauty.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Durable: </strong>Weather-resistant and long-lasting, suitable for indoor and outdoor use.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Eco-Friendly: </strong>Made from safe, non-toxic materials.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Variety: </strong>Diverse selection of plant types, sizes, and styles for any space.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Lightweight:</strong> Easy to move and reposition as needed.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Enhances Atmosphere:</strong> Adds a touch of nature to any environment.</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Stylish Design:</strong> Modern designs that complement various decor styles</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull;<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong> USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<strong>Ultra-Realistic Leaf Textures</strong>: Each plant is crafted with advanced technology to mimic the intricate textures of real leaves, bringing a touch of nature that&rsquo;s indistinguishable from the real thing.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><strong>Adaptable for Indoor and Outdoor Use</strong>: With UV-resistant materials, our plants are designed to withstand both indoor and outdoor environments without fading, making them versatile for any setting.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Easy Customization</strong>: Flexible branches and leaves allow for easy reshaping, letting you style the plant to fit your unique space and taste.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Enhanced Eco-Impact</strong>: Our plants are made using recyclable and non-toxic materials, offering a sustainable option for nature-inspired decor.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Stress-Free Aesthetics</strong>: Bring the calming presence of greenery into your life without the commitment&mdash;ideal for busy lifestyles and low-maintenance needs.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull;<span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> <strong>Payment terms:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Commissions are settled every 3 months and are paid via PayPal on the 15th of the settlement month. The minimum payout is $50. All commissions are subject to a 3 month review period to process any returns or cancellations.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&bull; Other information:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Brand introduction:</strong> We specialize in high-quality, realistic artificial plants that bring nature-inspired decor into any space.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Promotion policy:</strong> Promoters may not use paid search advertising for branded keywords.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Target audience:</strong> Ideal for home decor enthusiasts, small businesses, and commercial spaces.<br><strong></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Product highlights:</strong> Realistic appearance, zero maintenance, eco-friendly materials.</span></p>",
